#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニタ…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là một trong những chiếc màn hình mà Monokuma hay xuất hiện.\n"
"Hiện tại, nó chỉ đang hiển thị phù hiệu của trường.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>もう、こんな監視カメラなんか…
#. 心底どうでもいい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>From the bottom of my heart, I just really wanna...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Từ tận đáy lòng, mình thực sự chỉ muốn...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>本気で…壊してやろうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I'll just bust it to hell for real...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có lẽ mình cứ đập nát nó ra luôn cho rồi...!\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>物置には…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Look at this place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ごちゃごちゃと物が詰め込まれている。
#. 芝刈り機に植木鉢…肥料やら農具やら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Stuff's been just shoved wherever it fits. From a\n"
"lawnmower to fertilizer, flowerpots to farm tools...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ニワトリは…４羽に減ったままだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are still just the four chickens left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>元通りに増えたら…
#. 逆に怖いけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Honestly, I'd be kinda terrified if there were more\n"
"than that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマフラワーか…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The Monokuma Flower..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴミでもプラスチックでも人間でも食べるって…
#. 本当なのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is it true...? Does it really eat paper, plastic, and\n"
"people?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có thật không...? Nó thực sự ăn được cả giấy, nhựa, và con\n"
"người luôn sao?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>とにかく…事件には関係なさそうだし
#. この花には近付かない方がいいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think it's related to the case, so I'd\n"
"better keep my distance...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>スプリンクラーの制御パネルだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The sprinkler control panel...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>毎朝７時３０分にスプリンクラーが作動する設定で、
#. 設定の変更も不可能だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They're set to turn on at 7:30 every morning. And\n"
"Monokuma said the time positively couldn't be changed.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>天井の…あの突起物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Those nozzles poking out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Những cái vòi nhô ra kia...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. あれは…スプリンクラーか…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Are those...the sprinklers?"
msgstr "Đó có phải là... vòi phun nước không nhỉ?"

#. はい
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
